index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..b76fbbfcae4d59b56bcd52fcf76668c6315e7127
--- /dev/null
+++ b/release/relational-time-monotonic-evidence-sphere-zenodo-v1/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,57 @@
+# Canonical Zenodo anchor: relational time and the monotonically growing evidence sphere
+
+## Product-Owner publication order
+
+This release work unit prepares the existing byte-exact document
+
+`docs/publications/2026-08-12-observer-relative-retrocausality/QIK-VRT_Relationale_Zeit_und_wachsende_Evidenzkugel_DE.pdf`
+
+as the first canonical Zenodo anchor for subsequent QIK-VRT publication and repository-development work.
+
+The document is not rewritten, silently superseded, or relabelled as a new manuscript. Its historical bytes, title, authorship, rights boundary, and declared scientific limits are preserved.
+
+## Exact selected object
+
+```text
+REPOSITORY = Goldkelch/qik-vrt
+SELECTED_SNAPSHOT = 516af85d949c11623eb129392a61a0ce8088326c
+SELECTED_TREE = 9a522afeca2af88e7887940019cf6a2da06ae728
+PATH = docs/publications/2026-08-12-observer-relative-retrocausality/QIK-VRT_Relationale_Zeit_und_wachsende_Evidenzkugel_DE.pdf
+GIT_BLOB_SHA = 44aeb01177d0f830fdf18ca82278d055b09b2c56
+SHA256 = 38b0e62a46214a7cb9943dd3ef08283a70ae7e15ba22a59a9e53506f2945e311
+BYTES = 379427
+PAGES = 15
+PRESERVATION = PRESERVE_BYTE_EXACTLY_DO_NOT_OVERWRITE
+```
+
+## Canonical record identity
+
+```text
+PUBLICATION_ID = qikvrt-relational-time-monotonic-evidence-sphere-v1
+TITLE = Relationale Zeit, virtuelle Retrokausalität und die monoton wachsende Evidenzkugel
+CREATOR = Lohmann, Ingolf
+RIGHTS_HOLDER = Ingolf Lohmann
+LICENSE = CC-BY-NC-ND-4.0
+ACCESS = open
+VERSION = 1.0
+```
+
+The existing later synthesis record, DOI `10.5281/zenodo.21947141`, remains a separate record. It must not replace this exact anchor object. Once the anchor DOI is published and its public bytes are reverified, downstream QIK-VRT syntheses and routing toward arXiv, Wikipedia, IETF, IEEE, and later Zenodo records must cite or relation-bind the anchor.
+
+## Effect boundary
+
+This directory binds the selected object, metadata candidate, scientific claim boundary, Product-Owner directive, and publication-order invariant. It does not itself assert that Zenodo has created or published the new record.
+
+Completion requires one production Zenodo record whose public redownload is byte-identical to the selected PDF and whose DOI and receipt are persisted in the repository.
+
+```text
+ZENODO_RECORD_CREATED = NOT_YET_OBSERVED
+ZENODO_RECORD_PUBLISHED = NOT_YET_OBSERVED
+DOI_REGISTERED = NOT_YET_OBSERVED
+PUBLIC_BYTE_IDENTITY = NOT_YET_OBSERVED
+PEER_REVIEW = NOT_CLAIMED
+PHYSICAL_BACKWARD_CHANNEL = NOT_CLAIMED
+PASS = NOT_CLAIMED
+FINAL_PASS = NOT_CLAIMED
+GENERAL_EFFECT_ACK_DONE = NOT_CLAIMED
+```
